00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:49.280
So I want to take you on a little journey just for fun, maybe five minutes.

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:55.540
Let's review what it feels like—

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:03.100
when you first achieve real bodhichitta.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:12.480
So we're not talking about approximate—
what do you call it? Partial bodhichitta.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:15.980
Or trying to feel like you have bodhichitta.
Let's talk about the real thing.

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:24.120
When you see emptiness directly
and you immediately feel bodhichitta,

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:26.920
let's go through that because that's a good fortune.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.340
And that's an atomic bomb.

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:36.660
If you keep working on it, if you keep working on this,

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:41.200
on the feeling, if you keep listening to this part,

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:43.551
it will help destroy the virus.

00:17:43.551 --> 00:17:46.960
I believe it will help destroy the virus.
It's like a nuclear weapon.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:51.049
And this virus is like a soy sauce stain.
So  Here we go.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:18:00.380
Let's try to imagine for five minutes
what it would be like to attain bodhichitta.
Let's begin.

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.320
Let's take ten slow breaths.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:13.820
Focus on the exhale, a long exhale, don't worry about the inhale; your body will breathe.

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:52.540
So please imagine
that you have just seen emptiness directly.

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.450
And you come out of direct perception,

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:05.279
and you return to what we might call normal meditation, which is still not in the world.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:10.529
You are in deep meditation,
you are still on the cushion. Your

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.190
eyes are closed.

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:25.900
Then suddenly, in the forefront of your mind, an
image of your mother appears. This is your mother.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:36.500
A very perfect image of your mother. A living image.
It's actually your mother.

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:40.400
Maybe you should remember her.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.260
She looks like that now.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:51.140
She looks at you.
She looks into your eyes.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:58.700
Even though it feels like she's in the forefront of your mind, she looks into your eyes.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:10.260
With great love and also a sense of need.
She desperately needs help.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.440
She's in trouble.

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:23.120
Like she jumped off the Titanic or something,
and she looks at you with those eyes.
She says, "I need you, I need help."

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:42.560
And then you say to her out loud in your heart,
"Don't worry, Mom, I'll take care of you."

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:50.100
And I will.  Strong enough to take care of you.
Don't worry.

00:21:50.760 --> 00:21:59.080
I'll have the strength to help you,
and I will, I promise.

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:16.460
And then the picture fades to the front of your mind, and suddenly there's an image of your dad.

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:18.500
And you're looking at your dad.

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:31.260
And he has that same look in his eyes.
It's a kind of hope, but also fear.

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:37.400
So he's looking at you like,
"Can you help me?"

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:42.500
Things are getting tough in life, life is hard now.

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:47.360
And then you say, "Dad, don't worry.  I'll take care of it!

00:22:47.820 --> 00:22:49.820
I study lam rim.

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:54.120
I learned a lot about emptiness.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:23:01.280
And I actually know I'll have the tools
to help you soon.

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:04.680
So don't worry.  I'll take care of it.
I'll take care of it."

00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:09.540
And please don't-- don't be
afraid. Don't worry.

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:13.100
I know what to do and I'll do it.

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:17.120
Everything will be fine, so don't worry!

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:29.280
And then maybe someone else close in your life, your
wife or husband or children,
one of your children,

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:32.100
their image comes to the front of your mind.

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.140
Just their face.

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:44.940
And they're also looking at you like, "Can you help me?  Bad things, really bad things!”

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:50.940
Deadly things, there’s no hope.
Can you help me?

00:23:54.220 --> 00:24:02.140
And you say, “
I can handle it, I will handle it.
I can.

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:07.920
I will have enough strength to take care of you.

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:10.026
You don’t have to worry.

00:24:10.026 --> 00:24:11.623
I know what’s going on.

00:24:11.623 --> 00:24:13.220
I know your situation.

00:24:13.880 --> 00:24:17.015
I know what life is like.

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:24.500
I’ve found it
and I’ll take care of you completely.

00:24:24.680 --> 00:24:28.640
Don’t worry.
You don’t have to worry.

00:24:28.660 --> 00:24:31.320
I’ll take care of it.”

00:24:37.420 --> 00:24:43.320
And then the face fades and then you start to fill in the faces of people you know.

00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:48.000
Close people, close family.

00:24:49.260 --> 00:24:51.260
Uncles, aunts.

00:24:51.680 --> 00:24:53.680
Brothers and sisters.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:24:57.280
Nieces.

00:24:59.300 --> 00:25:07.420
One by one, you take them out
and you comfort them.

00:25:08.480 --> 00:25:12.920
And you say: “Indeed, I will take care of him.” There’s
nothing to worry about.”

00:25:19.120 --> 00:25:22.000
And in this way we solve everyone you know.

00:25:22.780 --> 00:25:25.480
Everyone you have ever met in life.

00:25:26.480 --> 00:25:33.840
Then you start working on all the people you haven't met and all the people in this whole world.

00:25:34.500 --> 00:25:36.500
Start with your own environment.

00:25:37.800 --> 00:25:45.820
Go to the city, the whole city, and you know, it's not like you can cover everyone.

00:25:46.440 --> 00:25:49.400
But take someone here and take someone there

00:25:50.940 --> 00:25:56.580
Take to the beach on this continent you live on.

00:25:57.640 --> 00:25:59.640
Protect everyone.

00:26:00.900 --> 00:26:02.900
And then go further.

00:26:03.860 --> 00:26:05.860
To another continent.

00:26:07.920 --> 00:26:13.480
And in this way we cover everyone in this world.

00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:18.400
Just sit here.

00:26:19.160 --> 00:26:23.820
And then you can start with the
animals in this world, on fish.

00:26:24.920 --> 00:26:34.380
I'm not talking about any kind of animal.
I'm talking about helping each individual animal.

00:26:36.500 --> 00:26:39.890
Each one is staring at you.  Everyone expects.

00:26:39.890 --> 00:26:44.260
Each one is afraid.
Each one gets your personal guarantee.

00:26:44.620 --> 00:26:46.620
"I'll take care of it. I'll take care of it."

00:26:48.770 --> 00:26:53.679
Then imagine encompassing every little creature, the little creature on the sea floor.

00:26:56.150 --> 00:26:58.150
Tiny creatures in your bloodstream.

00:26:59.780 --> 00:27:01.780
Meet one on one.

00:27:03.100 --> 00:27:05.260
Talk to them.

00:27:05.720 --> 00:27:13.720
And when you finish all the living beings in this world,
we will start on the next world.

00:27:13.720 --> 00:27:16.980
I don't know where the next world is.
I don't know what Alpha Centauri is?

00:27:17.660 --> 00:27:21.640
Maybe light years away.

00:27:24.040 --> 00:27:30.960
Go there and start doing the same meditation
for everyone in that world.

00:27:34.060 --> 00:27:41.660
And in this way we cover every world
in the entire universe.

00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:51.740
And karma meets one by one
each of the seven billion humans,

00:27:52.840 --> 00:27:57.600
and trillions of other beings on one planet,

00:27:58.060 --> 00:28:04.640
and then covers as many planets as there are.  Countless planets.

00:28:04.640 --> 00:28:06.640
Encompassing every being there,

00:28:09.680 --> 00:28:11.680
it is bodhichitta.

00:28:12.020 --> 00:28:15.820
That is the direct experience of bodhichitta.

00:28:15.840 --> 00:28:24.340
So please, for this episode,
if you can only get the feeling.

00:28:26.140 --> 00:28:31.260
You don't need to worry about yourself.
You don't have to worry about your family.

00:28:31.880 --> 00:28:35.080
You really don't have to worry about your country.

00:28:35.780 --> 00:28:40.740
And you don't have to worry about the world being covered by viruses.  It's the little things!

00:28:41.720 --> 00:28:47.680
We will take care of them.
We are working on a bigger project.

00:28:49.460 --> 00:28:54.820
We do it to help the entire universe.

00:28:55.920 --> 00:28:58.380
Countless billions of creatures.  There are

00:28:59.400 --> 00:29:03.560
countless billions of animals and other creatures.

00:29:05.140 --> 00:29:10.680
And we have that capacity.  You have that capacity.  I pray that you achieve that in this life.

00:29:11.240 --> 00:29:14.760
I pray that you achieve it in this life.

00:29:14.760 --> 00:29:28.840
Your mind already has the capacity to touch every living being and promise them that you will take care of them.

00:29:32.500 --> 00:29:36.700
So the purpose of this lam rim,
the purpose of this retreat,

00:29:37.420 --> 00:29:40.160
is kind of like to journey to the center of the sun.

00:29:40.600 --> 00:29:43.000
Think of every living creature.

00:29:43.360 --> 00:29:46.860
Many creatures live in the infinite universe.

00:29:48.320 --> 00:29:49.960
Meet them one by one.

00:29:49.960 --> 00:29:51.420
Promise one by one.

00:29:52.220 --> 00:29:58.360
That is what happened
during the first direct experience of bodhichitta.

00:29:58.360 --> 00:29:59.980
This really happened.

00:30:00.060 --> 00:30:01.843
That's how it feels.

00:30:01.843 --> 00:30:05.340
If you keep imagining it,
it will help it happen.

00:30:06.000 --> 00:30:07.020
Really!

00:30:07.020 --> 00:30:10.759
So it's up to you if you want it to come.

00:30:11.340 --> 00:30:14.660
If you really want to be a real bodhisattva,

00:30:15.680 --> 00:30:22.220
then practice.
Practice this visualization once or twice a day.

00:30:22.980 --> 00:30:28.140
Only if you have a few minutes.  Just imagine.
In your imagination.  Okay?

00:30:29.159 --> 00:30:32.989
And that will help make it happen.
And you will attain bodhichitta.

00:30:35.060 --> 00:30:43.120
Then something like a virus, for a bodhisattva type, this virus is not a very important thing.

00:30:43.120 --> 00:30:45.816
This is a very small thing.

00:30:45.820 --> 00:30:47.240
Make money.

00:30:47.820 --> 00:30:49.360
Earn a living.

00:30:49.600 --> 00:30:50.940
Feed your family.

00:30:51.600 --> 00:30:53.600
Looking for an apartment.

00:30:54.060 --> 00:30:58.660
These are very small things.  There is
n't anything.

00:31:00.240 --> 00:31:03.680
Your mind is like--
your heart is like the center of the sun.

00:31:05.180 --> 00:31:15.120
And some...I don't know...a little cake or some coca-cola in the sun, it doesn't matter.

00:31:16.380 --> 00:31:18.040
That's not important.

00:31:18.560 --> 00:31:20.220
Look for the big thing!

00:31:21.440 --> 00:31:23.662
Everything else becomes small.

00:31:23.662 --> 00:31:26.920
And everything else becomes comfortable.  Easy.

00:31:27.820 --> 00:31:29.820
That's bodhichitta.

00:31:40.500 --> 00:31:43.220
Okay!
See you in the next episode.

00:31:43.220 --> 00:31:44.480
Episode 10.

